## Architectural Components

```
data/
├── dataset.py                # Core Dataset classes, transforms, and DataLoader factories
├── __init__.py               # Clean public package exports
├── German Dataset/           # GTSRB (43 classes, Train/Test/Meta CSVs)
├── Belgian Dataset/          # BelgiumTSC (62 classes, PPM images, GT-*.csv)
└── Chinese Dataset/          # CTSD (58 classes, images/, annotations.csv)
```

### 1. Central Configuration ([`config.py`](file:///c:/Users/Regen/Machine%20Learning/ML_Project_RegSwaTan/config.py))
- Defines dataset root paths (`GERMAN_DATASET_DIR`, `BELGIAN_DATASET_DIR`, `CHINESE_DATASET_DIR`).
- Maintains class count mappings:
  ```python
  DATASET_NUM_CLASSES = {
      "german": 43,
      "gtsrb": 43,
      "belgian": 62,
      "btsc": 62,
      "chinese": 58,
      "ctsd": 58,
  }
  ```
- Normalization constants (GTSRB RGB statistics or ImageNet defaults) and default hyperparameters (`IMAGE_SIZE = (32, 32)`, `BATCH_SIZE = 64`, `VAL_SPLIT = 0.2`).

---

### 2. Dataset Implementations ([`data/dataset.py`](file:///c:/Users/Regen/Machine%20Learning/ML_Project_RegSwaTan/data/dataset.py))

#### A. German Dataset (`GTSRBDataset`)
- Reads `Train.csv` and `Test.csv`.
- Performs reproducible stratified splitting across 43 classes to produce training (31,367) and validation (7,842) subsets.
- Supports bounding box ROI cropping (`Roi.X1`, `Roi.Y1`, `Roi.X2`, `Roi.Y2`).

#### B. Belgian Dataset (`BelgianDataset`)
- Recursively parses `BelgiumTSC_Training/Training` and `BelgiumTSC_Testing/Testing` directory trees across all 62 class folders (`00000` to `00061`).
- Ingests semicolon-delimited `GT-*.csv` files, standardizing column headers case-insensitively.
- Loads 3-channel PPM images, supporting bounding box ROI cropping and stratified train/val splitting.

#### C. Chinese Dataset (`ChineseDataset`)
- Parses `annotations.csv` (`file_name, width, height, x1, y1, x2, y2, category`).
- Resolves images inside `images/` directory.
- Implements stratified 3-way partitioning (`70% train`, `15% validation`, `15% test`) across 58 categories.

#### D. Unified Dataset Wrapper (`TrafficSignDataset` & `get_dataset`)
- Standardized factory function instantiating any of the 3 datasets via a simple string identifier (`"german"`, `"belgian"`, or `"chinese"`).

---

### 3. Data Transformations & Augmentation (`get_transforms`)
- **Training Pipeline**:
  - `Resize(img_size)` (default 32x32 or 48x48)
  - `RandomRotation(±15°)`
  - `ColorJitter(brightness=0.2, contrast=0.2, saturation=0.2)`
  - `RandomAffine(translation=8%, scale=0.95-1.05)`
  - `ToTensor()`
  - `Normalize(mean, std)`
- **Validation & Testing Pipeline**:
  - `Resize(img_size)`
  - `ToTensor()`
  - `Normalize(mean, std)`

---

### 4. Unified DataLoader Factory (`get_dataloaders`)
Single-entry point for training scripts returning standard PyTorch `(train_loader, val_loader, test_loader)`:

```python
train_loader, val_loader, test_loader = get_dataloaders(
    dataset_name="german",  # or "belgian", "chinese"
    batch_size=64,
    img_size=(32, 32),
    val_split=0.2,
    num_workers=0,
)
```

