## Example Usage in Model Training

```python
from data import get_dataloaders
from models.model import get_model
from config import DATASET_NUM_CLASSES

# 1. Choose benchmark
benchmark = "chinese"  # "german" | "belgian" | "chinese"
num_classes = DATASET_NUM_CLASSES[benchmark]

# 2. Get DataLoaders
train_loader, val_loader, test_loader = get_dataloaders(
    dataset_name=benchmark,
    batch_size=64,
    img_size=(32, 32),
    val_split=0.2,
)

# 3. Instantiate model matching target class count
model = get_model(num_classes=num_classes)

# 4. Train loop
for images, labels in train_loader:
    logits = model(images)  # Output tensor shape: [64, num_classes]
    # loss = criterion(logits, labels)
    # ...
```
